<title>NETHERLANDS: ACF '96 NET DOWN IN LINE WITH FORECAST.</title>
<headline>ACF '96 NET DOWN IN LINE WITH FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Total net per shr (guilders)     2.65 vs   3.84</p>
<p>    Total net profit		    16.3  vs  22.3</p>
<p>    Net from ordinary operations    16.5  vs  28.1</p>
<p>    Extraordinary charges		  0  vs   5.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.05 vs   1.55</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.19 vs   1.29</p>
<p>NOTE - Pharmaceuticals group ACF Holding NV said in February</p>
<p>it expected the 1996 net profit to have fallen to about 16</p>
<p>million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
